{"4651180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Virtual Karting", "steam_appid": 4651180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real karting has a feel no simulator has ever captured. <strong>Virtual Karting</strong> is built to change that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed from hundreds of hours behind the wheel of real karts, every system in Virtual Karting is designed around authentic physical behavior - the flexing chassis, the biting tires, the subtle weight shifts that decide an entire corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT SETS IT APART</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Physics-first simulation: chassis flex, VR mimicked body weight shift, and tire dynamics built from real-world data</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Detailed setup system: adjust wheelbase, track width, ride height, toe, camber, caster, tire pressure, and much more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Designed for real racers: if you've driven a kart, you'll feel the difference immediately</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS IS EARLY ACCESS BUILT WITH THE COMMUNITY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access focuses on exposing the core foundation early. Test it, break it, push it. Your feedback directly shapes the simulator.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real karting has a feel no simulator has ever captured. <strong>Virtual Karting</strong> is built to change that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed from hundreds of hours behind the wheel of real karts, every system in Virtual Karting is designed around authentic physical behavior - the flexing chassis, the biting tires, the subtle weight shifts that decide an entire corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT SETS IT APART</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Physics-first simulation: chassis flex, VR mimicked body weight shift, and tire dynamics built from real-world data</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Detailed setup system: adjust wheelbase, track width, ride height, toe, camber, caster, tire pressure, and much more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Designed for real racers: if you've driven a kart, you'll feel the difference immediately</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS IS EARLY ACCESS BUILT WITH THE COMMUNITY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access focuses on exposing the core foundation early. Test it, break it, push it. Your feedback directly shapes the simulator.</p>", "short_description": "A ground-up karting simulator built on real racing experience. Authentic chassis flex, VR mimicked body weight shift, and tire dynamics that make a kart feel truly alive.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651180/4a5166a06f7f9f227b000d814ac34ab319d56f03/header.jpg?t=1785490499", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651180/24467958eae495296a6507a6ed2cd84dcbc1de8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785490499", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651180/24467958eae495296a6507a6ed2cd84dcbc1de8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785490499", "website": "https://www.virtualkarting.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 or AMD RX 5600 XT (6GB VRAM minimum)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></